      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Retrospective case records analysis of 126 patients operated on in urologic department for the kidney cancer during 1970-1991 yrs period of time. The severity of such symptoms as hematuria, pain and palpable tumor in accordance with various morphological types of the disease was studied up. The data obtained witnesses the presence of close correlational relation between morphological form of kidney cancer and clinical features of the disease, and that's why they can be used as the diagnostic and practical guides."},
